If an opioid-benefit outweighs an opioid-risk for a patient and there is a clinician then it is recommended that the clinician does not insist on an opioid-taper for the patient.
If an opioid-benefit outweighs an opioid-risk for a patient and there is a clinician then it is recommended that the clinician does not insist on an opioid-discontinuation for the patient.
